    can activate this effect; during the Standby Phase of the next turn, add 1 card
    from your GY to your hand, with an effect that Fusion Summons a monster(s). When
    your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card or effect (Quick Effect): You can banish
    1 face-up LIGHT Machine monster you control or 2 LIGHT Machine monsters from
    your GY; negate the activation. You can only use each effect of "Heosvarog the
    Mechanical Dawn" once per turn.'
